h did  manage to form another more unorthodox  bond at this time with a pill a man by  the name of wamu  after discovering all three remaining  pillarmen in a secret roman cave both  joseph and caesar were easily defeated  by wamu and on the verge of being killed  however joseph was able to use his  trademark cunning to appeal to wamu's  sense of warrior's honor and a lust for  challenge by informing  wamu that he had yet to complete his sum  on training and that wamu could only  prove that he was the superior warrior  by beating joseph at his best and you  know what that gambit worked  joseph was spared however to prevent him  from simply running away  both wamu and another pillar man ac dc  inserted rings containing poison into  jose's body that were set to dissolve in  a month's time meaning that joseph would  have to become strong and skillful  enough to defeat at least two pillar men  within a mere month  quite the tough ask but in aid of this  joseph traveled to venice with caesar  and they underwent intensive hormone  training under the tutelage of lisa lisa  oops spoiler alert also turns out to be  joseph's mother although joseph was  rather unaware of this when he was  spying on her naked that one time  some very oedipus-y sort of stuff  happening here in battle tendency but  it's also worth noting that joseph would  meet a lady of his own in venice being  lisa lisa's servant susie q but more  about her in a bit because three weeks  after joseph's training began the  grounds were invaded by ac dc who would  be defeated thanks to a series of  fantastically implemented  ideas from joseph and he managed to  attain the antidote for one of his  internal poison ring things  from here joseph caesar and lisa lisa  traveled to switzerland to confront wamu  and the leader of the pillarman cars  which would lead to caesar's tragic  death at the hands of wamu and quite  possibly the most emotional moment of  the entirety of the life and times of  joseph joestar where after a profound  moment of despair joseph once again  resolved to defeat wamu which he would  in a  roman chariot style jewel which was was  unique and it would involve a whole host  of  other improbably well thought out ideas  which really is the strong suit of  joseph but even after beating wamu and  saving his life from the deadly deadly  poison  we still had cars a being who had now  found his way up into impossible power  and after putting a thing in another  thing he  had now become the ultimate life form  and in order to defeat this final pillar  man  joseph led cars to a volcano whereby a  mighty enhanced haman eruption occurred  and joseph knocked cars out of earth's  orbit where he would go on to float  through the universe  for all eternity and then later on  joseph went on to crash his own funeral  as well as marry susie q  thus bringing a rather happy ending to  battle tenancy however joseph's journey  was ever so far from done and he would  continue the joe style line by having a  daughter named holly whom joseph  treasured more than anyone else in this  world which is why when holly grew up  and moved to japan with her husband  sadao joseph developed a general dislike  of japanese people  although with that said he would go on  to have an affair with a japanese woman  by the name of tomoko higashikata an  affair that would produce yet  another jojo but before we get into that  at the age of 65 joseph jostar very  mysteriously manifested an ability known  as a stand which in this case was named  hermit purple  a funky little existence that allowed  joseph to spawn thorny vines which were  capable of conducting hamon as well and  yeah it sounds pretty underwhelming but  in the hands of a trickster like joseph  joestar it became  quite an effective utility the most  important feature of homopurple though  is that it allowed joseph to engage in  divination by using an object like say a  camera or a tv  and with a target in mind he could then  attain a picture of said target  however the reason for joseph developing  this ability had to do with dio the  immortal rival of joseph's grandfather  who had resurfaced back into the world  having  fixed his head to jonathan's body and  presenting the greatest enemy that the  joestar family had ever faced however  joseph was not the only one to develop a  stand out of nowhere as he received a  call from holly stating that her son and  joseph's grandson jotaro had been  possessed by an evil spirit and so at  the age of 67  joseph traveled to japan and thus began  the events of part three stardust  crusaders upon arriving in japan joseph  discovered his grandson in prison having  manifested a stance that would become  known as star platinum an existence far  more powerful than joseph's home at  purple and after an altercation joseph  explained their family's past with dio  as well as recruited jotaro in an effort  to stop him a big push towards this so  was that holly had also manifested a  stand which she did not possess the  spirit to harness and so it began slowly  killing her giving joseph and jotaro an  estimated 50 days to find and kill dear  theoretically then breaking his link to  the jostar family  and saving holly on this journey though  joseph would be joined by his good  friend and colleague mohammad abdul and  these two had a good working  relationship in fact avdor was the  individual who  taught joseph about the very nature of  stance also amongst their group was a  high school student oriaki kokuin a man  who had been previously brainwashed by  dio  or brain bugged brain infested i don't  know what you would actually call it but  if every member within this group joseph  probably had the least  on-screen interaction with kakuin  however the two had a clear respect for  one another and trusted each other  implicitly  furthermore joseph had a tendency to  bombard kaku in with jokes because this  polite school student was the most  tolerant of his foolishness  shortly after their departure joseph and  the group were also joined by  jean-pierre palnar a personality that  was much more let's say  agreeable with joseph due to his goofy  nature and our final crusader would be  iggy a stray dog and stand user as well  as all around good boy and so this pack  would travel across the world having  tracked dio to egypt in an adventure  that would reveal how joseph had truly  changed over the years  most evidently joseph no longer  possessed his aggressively energetic and  borderline arrogant nature and he was  instead much more calm and calculated  for the most part anyway he was also  demonstrably much more worldly and  mature as well as capable of acting as a  leader whereas our young joseph was much  more of a rogue agent however he did  still retain his clownish nature  and often used it for the purposes of  comedy in part three although with that  said he was also able to provide  something of a role model for his  grandson jotaro they say something of a  role model because their personalities  were  polar opposites however in the end these  two developed an extraordinary bond  which would prove to be a formidable  team going up against whatever  unfortunate soldiers happen to cross  their path and that brings us to dio who  by this point possessed a stand known as  the world which allowed him to stop time  briefly  and made effectively the entire band of  crusaders powerless against him which  was displayed to us when dio mercilessly  killed kakyoin but not before he was  able to send a very valuable  message to joseph informing out once  plucky joestar of dio's time-related  abilities  simply knowing dio's power would not  grant joseph any advantage whatsoever  though and after warning his grandson  joseph was stabbed through the throat  and subsequently had his blood sucked  out by dio thus killing him  or not after george roy successfully  defeated dio he engaged the medics of  the speedwagon foundation to perform a  blood transfusion from dio's body to  joseph's a process that miraculously  worked  and brought joseph back to life and even  in this the most serious of situations  joseph's first thought was to play a  prank on his grandson pretending that he  was deo and some classic  joseph joe star right there but on a  more somber note joseph and jotaro  successfully rid this world of dio by  burning his body with the rising sun  whilst also taking the time to mourn  their lost companions  then the three remaining crusaders would  exchange a heartfelt goodbye with joseph  and jotura returning to japan in order  to find a fully recovered holly which  brought an end to part three  of jojo's bizarre adventure and while  this would be the end of joseph's tenure  in a primary role his life would go on  and on however over the next decade age  absolutely caught up with him joseph  began suffering a wide array of both  physical and mental conditions but  during this time joseph also lamented on  his affair which had produced a son  named josuke higashikata whom joseph  added to his will and attempted to use  hermit purple to attain a picture of  however what emerged was quite an  ominous photo after which jojoro  embarked on a journey to mario in order  to investigate thus beginning part four  diamond is unbreakable although  eventually a very frail 79 year old  joseph droster would also travel to the  small japanese town where he would meet  his son josuke for the first time and  while josuke expressly forbade joseph  from contacting his mother tomoko this  father and son would eventually form a  bond of their own  primarily through an incident involving  an invisible baby the baby that would  take quite well to the elderly joseph  and he would later adopt and name she's  a good joster an act that would further  estrange joseph from his wife susa q who  was already livid about his affair  and would likely believe that shizuka  was yet another secret love child of  joseph and as such joseph would spend  the majority of his time in part 4  caring for shizuka  until the threat in moria was defeated  at which point he left the town with  shusika and jotaro and that really is  more or less the end of the adventures  of joseph joestar some more fun facts  about joseph joestar  despite his last appearance being in  part 4 araki did confirm in an interview  that joseph was likely still alive by  the time we reached part 6  being stone ocean and this would make  him 91 at the time of those events  as we've just seen joseph led quite the  bizarre life having taken part in  defeating an immortal vampire as well as  the ultimate life form but to add to  that joseph has also survived no  less than four plane crashes two of  which being in battle tendency and two  of which were in stardust crusaders and  finally a truly useless fact  in part three there is a running gag  with joseph's prosthetic hand where it  will be periodically damaged or even  destroyed  only to appear later being completely  intact without any explanation  whatsoever but that pretty much does it  for joseph joestar but what do you guys  think please do let me know down in the  comments below or even join my discord  server and if you're keen for some more  jojo content then please do go and check  out some of my other videos or even  subscribe to the channel for regular  jojo wonder delivered straight  to your youtube feed but for now this  has been the new world review and i'll  see you next time

